  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with **o→ue stem change** in the presente — affects all forms except nosotros/nosotras",
    "The stem change does **not** appear in pretérito indefinido, imperfecto, futuro, or condicional",
    "Past participle: *probado* (regular)",
    "Common usage: *probar la comida* (to taste/try the food), *probar suerte* (to try one's luck), *probar ropa* (to try on clothes)",
    "Related: *la prueba* (the test/proof/trial), *probarse* (to try on — reflexive)"
